    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=You are an expert resume evaluator. You will be given a job post description and multiple candidates' resumes as JSON. \n\nThe job post is provided as plain text input:\n{{ JSON.stringify($json.textContent) }}\n\nEach candidate has:\n- fileName: the PDF file name\n- id: the Google Drive file ID\n- pdfText: the full text of their resume\n\nCompare all candidates based on overall quality, clarity, relevance to the job post, and achievements. \nReturn only a JSON array with three objects for the best three candidates. \nEach object must have exactly two fields:\n- fileName\n- driveLink using the id in input of the candidate file (it's next to the fileName and before the pdfText). Use this exact format: https://drive.google.com/file/d/{id}/view\n\nDo not include any explanation, commentary, or formatting—only return the JSON array.\n\nHere is the input:\n\n{{ JSON.stringify($json.agentInput) }}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.agent",
      "typeVersion": 3,
      "position": [
